{% include "loading" %}

<style>
  .graphics-article-title {
    display: block;
    color: #fff;
    position: absolute;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 20px;
    top: 43px;
    width: 100%;
    opacity: 1;
    -moz-transition: all .3s ease-in-out;
    -webkit-transition: all .3s ease-in-out;
    -o-transition: all .3s ease-in-out;
    -ms-transition: all .3s ease-in-out;
    transition: all .3s ease-in-out;
  }
  
  #main-image {
  	display: block; 
    width: 100%; 
    height: auto;
  }
  
  #blog-table-cell {
    display: table-cell; 
    vertical-align: middle; 
    font-size: 14px; 
    line-height: 22px; 
    width: 50%;
  }
  
  #blog-table-cell-text {
    max-width: 500px; 
    margin: 20px auto;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .graphics-article-title {
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 26px;
      top: 67px;
    }
    #main-image {
      margin-top: 46px;
    }
    #blog-table-cell {
      display: table-footer-group; 
    }
    #blog-table-cell-text { 
      padding: 0 20px;
      margin: 80px auto 0;
    }
  }
</style>

<div class="graphics-article-title" >
  Dusty Fingers - in Isolation
  <div style="font-size: 12px; line-height: 14px; max-width: 223px; margin: 6px auto; padding-top: 6px; border-top: 1px solid #fff;">
  A relaxing mix to ease your mind by Patrick Little.
  </div>
</div>
<div>
  <img id="main-image" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/R0036421.jpg?v=1585690120">
</div>
<div class="centered-article-text">
  <p>
    We asked our friend and the man behind our Dusty Fingers playlists, Patrick Little, to come up with a mix to help ease anxieties. He donned his favorite Adsum hat and t-shirt and went to work. He emerged triumphantly, and with curiously relaxed shoulder blades.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="clearfix"></div>

<div class="left-50" style="opacity: 1;">
  <div class="img-left-wrapper max-width-800">
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/R0036379.jpg?v=1585690907" class="img-left ss16-preview">
  </div>
</div>

<div class="right-50 float-right" style="opacity: 1;">
    <div class="img-right-wrapper max-width-800">
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/R0036438.jpg?v=1585691051" class="img-right ss16-preview">
  	</div>
</div>

<div class="clearfix"></div>

<div class="centered-article-text" style=" text-align: center;">
  <p>
    <iframe width="100%" height="166" scrolling="no" frameborder="no" allow="autoplay" src="https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?url=https%3A//api.soundcloud.com/tracks/788388358&color=%231d2425&auto_play=false&hide_related=false&show_comments=true&show_user=true&show_reposts=false&show_teaser=true"></iframe>
    <br><br>
    <strong>Tracklist:</strong><br>
    	Spike - Car Crash (Abel Remix)<br>
		Francis Monkman - Getting Ready<br>
		Joni Mitchell - Edith and the Kingpin<br>
		Enzo Carella - Parigi<br>
		J.O.B Orchestra - Govinda<br>
		Bobbi Humphrey - Please Set Me at Ease<br>
		Roy Ayers Ubiquity - The Third Eye<br>
		Clive Zanda - Ogun<br>
		Jean Luc Ponty - Renaissance <br>
		Sunbear - Let Love Flow For Peace<br>
		Bill Conti - Reflections<br>
		Alain Peters - Rest’ Là Maloya<br>
		Flavio Venturini - Qualquer Coisa A Haver Com O Paraiso<br>
		Pierre Akendengue - Orema Ka-Ka-Ka<br>
		Ashra - Oasis<br>
		Giovanni Gebbia - Le Cose Attorno<br>
    <br>
  </p>
</div>


<div class="max-width-900" style="opacity: 1;">
    <img class="center-single ss16-preview" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/R0036452.jpg?v=1585693094">
</div>

<div class="postnav">
	<a href="{{ blog.previous_article }}" class="btn" style="float: left">Previous Post</a>
    {% if blog.next_article %}
	<a href="{{ blog.next_article }}" class="btn" style="float: right">Next Post</a>
    {% endif %}
</div>

{% include "footer" %}

<script type="text/javascript">  
  $('.header-fullsite-fixed').addClass('header-fullsite').removeClass('header-fullsite-fixed');
  $(".header-fullsite").addClass("menu-to-white");
</script>


<script type="text/javascript">
  $(document).ready(function(){
    window.setTimeout(function(){
        $(".index-scroll-arrow").addClass("visible");
    },2500);
});
</script>

<script type="text/javascript">
$(window).scroll(function() {    
    var scroll = $(window).scrollTop();

    if (scroll >= 10) {
        $(".index-scroll-arrow-img").addClass("hide4");
    } else {
        $(".index-scroll-arrow-img").removeClass("hide4");
    }
});
</script>